          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>抵抗力·恢复力<br />冗余度三维思路</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 12, height: 106 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>09-23</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>重庆路网与<br />桥隧数据整理</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderLeft: '3px solid #1E4FA8', padding: 12, height: 106 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>10-20</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>初步模拟完成<br />得到恢复曲线</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px dashed #1E4FA8', padding: 12, height: 106 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8' }}>下一步</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 6 }}>拓展三维指标<br />识别关键桥隧</Text>
